{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ed834952-0f9a-859c-b1b8-f1d8b97a30e3",
  "created_at": "2026-03-10T09:53:18-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Conceicao Costa",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:51:17-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:51:21-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. I need to put out a couch. Old couch, it is too big for regular trash. Nobody told me how to do it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:51:30-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, bulk item, couch. Sure, I can help with that. What's the address where it's going out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:51:37-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "406 Narragansett Avenue. Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:51:40-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 406 Narragansett. Let me pull up your pickup day here. Bear with me a second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:51:47-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Sorry, I have my grandchild with me on speaker, she is [pause] she is home from school today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:51:54-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Stop, Dasha. Please. She is laughing at the phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:51:58-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. Hi there, Dasha. Okay, so I'm showing your regular trash day is Thursday, so the next pickup would be this Thursday, the twelfth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:52:08-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thursday. So I put couch out Wednesday night?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:52:12-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, Wednesday evening is fine, or early Thursday morning. Just get it out by the curb before the trucks come. Now, bulk items sometimes need to be scheduled, so I'm going to note that you're calling about the couch and have somebody confirm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:52:27-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Confirm? Why it is not simple? Last time I put big box out and they left it. Nobody said why."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:52:34-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's usually because it wasn't set up ahead of time. That's why I'm writing this down. Couch, 406 Narragansett, Thursday pickup. Is there a number to reach you in case they need anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:52:46-04:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0160."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:52:47-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one six zero. Perfect. I'll get this into the system today, and if there's an issue somebody will call you back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:52:55-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I can put it out Wednesday, yes or no? I do not want fine for leaving on street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:53:02-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wait until you hear from us or until Wednesday afternoon. If nobody's called by then, give us a ring and we'll tell you for sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:53:11-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Fine. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:53:13-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it. Take care, and bye to Dasha too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:53:17-04:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye."
    }
  ],
